<http://data.silknow.org/object/2f9a4fd2-1155-3618-863a-a9aad8ffa553/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ground: Compound weave of ivory silk and silver tinsel.  Design: Two pairs of undulating ribbons, on scalloped, one plain, brocaded in gilded silver wire and silks.  At each curve of the plain one, a spray of flowers brocaded in polychrome silks, silver tinsel wound on a silk core and frisé silver yarn, the sprays tied with a fluttering ribbon brocaded in silk.  In the interspaces, small floral sprays.  Selvedges on both sides of four cords and a wide stripe.  Soiled and spotted.  Metallic threads very worn.  Holes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/2f9a4fd2-1155-3618-863a-a9aad8ffa553> .

