        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: Compound weave of ivory silk and silver tinsel.  Design: Two pairs of undulating ribbons, on scalloped, one plain, brocaded in gilded silver wire and silks.  At each curve of the plain one, a spray of flowers brocaded in polychrome silks, silver tinsel wound on a silk core and frisé silver yarn, the sprays tied with a fluttering ribbon brocaded in silk.  In the interspaces, small floral sprays.  Selvedges on both sides of four cords and a wide stripe.  Soiled and spotted.  Metallic threads very worn.  Holes."@en ;
